WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.030
- But wait have any of your
Office people have they

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:02.863
come to see you?

00:00:02.863 --> 00:00:04.830
- Yes, Angela came the first week.

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:08.650
Oscar came, Andy Buckley
who played David Wallace.

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.400
Creed Bratton, who plays Creed Bratton

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.470
and Leslie David Baker, who plays Stanley.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:14.661
- Oh my god that's so supportive.

00:00:14.661 --> 00:00:15.599
(audience applauds)

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:16.690
I love that.

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:17.900
- I know and I've gotten so such support,

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.980
even online from Jenna, Steve
Carell did a video for me.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:22.813
I mean--

00:00:22.813 --> 00:00:23.646
- He's the nicest.

00:00:23.646 --> 00:00:24.479
- He's the greatest.

00:00:24.479 --> 00:00:25.312
- He did something very lovely--

00:00:25.312 --> 00:00:27.290
- Of course he did when
they pulled his hair out,

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:28.380
he yelled Kelly Clarkson.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.670
- I was always kind of
like, was it a compliment?

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.100
I don't know.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.760
You're in pain and you think of me.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.350
I ran into him and I asked his wife,

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:38.120
I was like, you give the
truth and she did. (laughs)

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:39.000
It was nice.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.160
I do hear that there might
be a reboot of The Office,

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.410
is that real because can I
sign a petition of something.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.670
- I am not the one getting in
the way if that his happening.

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:46.990
I would love to.

00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:50.360
Seriously it was the best
nine years of my life, ever.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:52.090
- How many great actors.
- And the fact that it still

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:52.994
lives oh my gosh.

00:00:52.994 --> 00:00:54.920
People are living and
breathing The Office right now.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:56.670
Like literally they will come up to you

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:58.680
and say, "I fall asleep
to you every night."

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:00.020
Now a few years ago
that might creep me out

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:00.900
but I like it now.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:01.733
(audience laughs)

00:01:01.733 --> 00:01:02.566
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:02.566 --> 00:01:03.440
You know what I mean
because literally they say,

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:04.960
I watch it all, it's like a white noise

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.130
I leave it on all day, all day.

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:07.110
I'm like, wait a minute,

00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:08.090
that means you're not paying attention

00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:09.843
but it's like in their bones.

00:01:10.838 --> 00:01:11.671
- But it's that entertaining.

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:14.090
It's good, it's great writing great cast.

